  "html": "<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"----------png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:132px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/zh/wiki/File:%E8%81%94%E7%BB%9C%E5%91%98.png\" title=\"联络员.png (575 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:132px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/3/37/%E8%81%94%E7%BB%9C%E5%91%98.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/132?cb=20251024095335&amp;path-prefix=zh\" title=\"联络员.png (575 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"联络员.png\" data-image-key=\"%E8%81%94%E7%BB%9C%E5%91%98.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"联络员.png (575 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"联络员.png\" data-image-key=\"%E8%81%94%E7%BB%9C%E5%91%98.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/3/37/%E8%81%94%E7%BB%9C%E5%91%98.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/132?cb=20251024095335&amp;path-prefix=zh\"></a></div></div></div></div><p>【角色名】联络员\n</p><p>【初始区域】见特性\n</p><p>【禁行区域】见特性\n</p><p>【不安限度】 3\n</p><p>【属性】 见特性\n</p><p>【特性】剧本制作时，为该角色指定1个初始区域（可以是远方），至多1个禁行区域，和至多2个角色属性\n</p><p>【友好能力】（友好1）公开该角色选择的属性和禁行区域\n</p><p>（友好3）选同一区域任意1名角色并选择友好/不安，如果那名角色与该角色有相同的属性则放置1枚指示物，如果所有属性皆相同，则额外放置1枚指示物\n</p><p>【感想】　正体不明的联络员，可以是你，也可以是我\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260927033404\nCache expiry: 120960